Upstream fixes to the Windows backend after 0.17.0 (https://github.com/frankosterfeld/qtkeychain):
  3288f636a Windows: Fix some compiler warnings (prerequisite of the next one)
  987522a32 windows: Fix error reported for missing credentials (EntryNotFound, not OtherError)
  e98369d74 windows: Fix leak of credentials read (CredFree was never called on the read credential)
Drop this patch when the port moves to a release that contains them.

diff --git a/qtkeychain/keychain_win.cpp b/qtkeychain/keychain_win.cpp
index e2cbc8a..55e05e6 100644
